GPU NVIDIA A10, driver 580.105.08, persistence mode Enabled, start power limit 105.00 W, workload tools/gpu_workload.py (seeded fp16 matmul request stream).
5 repetitions, order rotated, 300.0 s per arm plus 30.0 s drain, 60.0 s idle before each arm.

Phase: **confirm**. Omni frozen at commit cafb516b0fb8; file hashes in FREEZE.json, rechecked at the end.

