## Verdict on the preregistered question

Work per energy under Omni against native: 58.05 -> 59.31 served requests per kJ, difference +1.261 (95% interval +1.041 to +1.48).
Guardrails: requests served held (not below -1%), 95th-percentile response time held (not above +10%), requests not served held (not above +1% of native served).
Observation (watch against native) on the same outcome: EVEN, under the floor. Authority (omni against watch): GAIN, clear of the noise.
**Result, by rule: GAIN (within the guardrails).**

